cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this atlas or its code, please cite it as below."
title: "An open, genetics-anchored plasma immunome atlas"
abstract: >-
  A fully reproducible, public-data plasma immunome atlas that maps the Olink
  plasma immune proteome to disease through a four-layer causal-evidence arc
  (cis-eQTL Mendelian randomization, transcript colocalization, protein-level
  INTERVAL pQTL validation, and independent OpenGWAS replication), recovering
  established therapeutic immune axes and nominating colocalized, replicated
  autoimmune targets.
authors:
